# Steps said only in words stay as words (GAP009); open questions are listed.
:inputs intervals

say Sort the intervals by start, then merge the overlapping ones.
add root:
    intent sort the intervals by their start
    merged = []
    for interval~loopvar in intervals:
        intent merge interval into the last one if they overlap
    return merged
expect gaps GAP009 GAP009

say Does "overlap" include intervals that only touch?
ask Do touching intervals count as overlapping? -- n10

say Sorting is intervals.sort with a key on the start.
replace n2: intervals.sort(key=?value"the start of each interval")
expect error syntax
replace n2: intervals.sort(?value"by the start of each interval")
expect gaps GAP005 GAP009
:coverage
